JXl_ua4c4n9v2a0TSdqI5mtMqOFHE7g1tpOFl2pVcEjQ&oe=6A998EC4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TiNLFfe1Qb0Q7kNvwFL0a71&_nc_oc=AdrfTyp1To0Qw6pWVpZ8UrYCJwYI6F8GzI2dh9NJoYr_O0B-ECaXk48fE9sm62fs5mk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIfR3ZU8vVOs7aW5WpVXcMYJZ9DDs-bv19PSL0Q8KiR-w&oe=6A997362"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vpqxZ-nxRRQQ7kNvwG4Vj8J&_nc_oc=Adr5dorCYoDqbIOUcMwAcxVwTfa8Y1n37vlg3dBT1hAUONCPWqvXR-DAXs_5e_FI444&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK9xojLmsLH_YrR1kYrKosGgPpPKaRk-hC38PGvro0lgA&oe=6A9995B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iFqw4STvjO8Q7kNvwHqyLlF&_nc_oc=Adq2EJhD43ONN8w8lQ0J5k9cFmIhRJ5KOu4ITZ61nRg4wtGqBumT01qq-ujcmmgTCD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKY8eXIwjA5EnmcZrDuakVPhmWoZ00WwnMLFB2klFedoA&oe=6A9994AF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Om1R5LOiU2sQ7kNvwGQ5QmL&_nc_oc=AdpukPFolVHCvjHWq9x97b62ND2djFiXAzdNpCD8irvujbZ8lYOZJKuU-edwtgKnbLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLTlZmz_z6vNZnLoiCd8r_yT9Tr2XnpffoqanIrDxGf6Q&oe=6A9990A5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m5WbgtuZ9tQQ7kNvwEVOY8U&_nc_oc=AdrdSk6EFmydNu90OaTEitmbxxpv-3dGbY8WHlOIWglxQdI0bNTsvIV_qhyqepj0y3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKcm4uloYm5gglaPbYVqFc5oGyrEamgoU8EZbAYDPlWxA&oe=6A998F8D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XN-WQH1ndEcQ7kNvwG9SPdK&_nc_oc=AdpK8aEx8ha6sbGxCBLrf6Yvt2dt-8FGMV8Ato8v1KOMyZgtKmYyPuJW9CjFV1jyKaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=